# Build context allowlist for deploy/railway/clickhouse/Dockerfile.
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` from beside the Dockerfile in
# preference to the context root's `.dockerignore`, so this file scopes THIS
# build only — the repo has no root `.dockerignore`, and adding one would
# change every other build in the tree (apps/web, services/ingest, compose).
#
# The context is the repo root (2.1 GB: node_modules, .next, .git, and
# apps/web/.env.local) and this image needs exactly one file out of it. Deny
# everything, re-admit that one path. BuildKit only transfers the paths a COPY
# names, so today's measured transfer is already 231 B — this file makes that a
# rule of the build rather than a property of the builder's optimiser, and it
# is what keeps a developer's .env.local out of the daemon if the build ever
# runs on the classic builder or gains a second COPY.
*
!deploy/compose/clickhouse/users.d/obstack-users.xml
!deploy/railway/clickhouse/config.d/**
